# No Python interop

`agentd` is 100% Mojo. Do not add `Python.import_module`, `PythonObject`,
`src/interop/python`, or `src/python`.

| Need | Native place |
| --- | --- |
| env | `std.os.getenv` in `infrastructure/settings.mojo` |
| TCP | libc FFI in `infrastructure/net/tcp.mojo` |
| agent graph | `application/graph/runtime.mojo` |
| tokenizer | `infrastructure/local/tokenizer.mojo` |
| embeddings | `infrastructure/local/embeddings.mojo` + `hash_embed` |
| generate | `infrastructure/local/llm.mojo` |

External model serving is another process over HTTP/gRPC, not CPython in-process.
